DynaMoSSL without Hugging Face accelerate (not in the locked environment).

models/ssl/dynamo.py builds a module-level accelerate.Accelerator() at import and passes the forward-dynamics
model and its optimizer through accelerator.prepare(). For the official single-process fp32 launch
(`python3 train.py`, no accelerate config) prepare() only moves the model to the device and wraps the optimizer
without changing its step; the splatter4d adapter moves DynaMoSSL to the device itself
(s4d/baselines/dynamo/model.py). No other line changes.

